WEBVTT

00:00:05.641 --> 00:00:09.972
Open your company's news page on Yahoo Finance

00:00:09.972 --> 00:00:15.493
Scroll down to the stories about its latest earnings report

00:00:15.493 --> 00:00:21.302
Skip the company's own announcement: it says nothing about estimates

00:00:21.302 --> 00:00:31.221
Open a news story whose headline says the company beat or missed the estimates

00:00:31.221 --> 00:00:37.149
Copy the headline exactly

00:00:37.149 --> 00:00:48.581
Find the day of the report and one number for sales or profit
